ng?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_uvUCDYBrsgQ7kNvwH8U3vh&_nc_oc=AdpwHb2em0mvy4za51Fhd8oEVy6iogGNSI8ShfFc40Xpwf6aKGG-PvjtsMiB5R62nQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAoX7aR8EyWzRqTIKG83X_rcCRbnw5qIzo3SCK4Qx_aqA&oe=6A68B0B0"}, {"file_name": "5s.png", "id": "853962077500782", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_853962080834115_6033988300909686503_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZT47E6ufH_0Q7kNvwFRWfkV&_nc_oc=AdqcWHH4fUekFGIKD9Pw6A4D6TVvWNKYhpiSQABV7OG34V90nsdj0-4h4w9HEGlt7r0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCFSjkaFG1n3T18ppzzx6cb3ha-uUijbV9OEZT8eQPzHA&oe=6A68ABC9"}, {"file_name": "4s.png", "id": "2094756694440488", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_2094756697773821_3073501323778327115_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D3j28kaAJV8Q7kNvwFj3mUF&_nc_oc=AdoGH8MBDm1MEPuxzRgSWdgK1LOhC0C5I9Z9nJgAiQr7YRhvW0mUAFmVnFoL5RNJ6es&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAD6mUbm7YO44tWm_C_eeSQbtcTROxrNqzrJHrwzLHN8g&oe=6A68C01F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560X1440.png", "id": "1668501157702651", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654944867_1668501161035984_577899702233994268_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Oc0XbPSlUwQ7kNvwH02Fri&_nc_oc=AdpCe0TMZhvwdzrabSlXVBxesk4-8AIxY_Ku8JHik1r38Jv-5W4EDbdHevMum8caUJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDvG2uEkRasTihXRjJzjv3bIVGJ2XRhb-qJpQbgMtkVYA&oe=6A68C021"}, "display_name": "Arctic Expedition: Physics Sandbox", "keywords": ["OpenWorldVR", "FlightSimulator", "ArcticAdventure", "FamilyVR", "ExplorationVR"], "long_description": "**ESCAPE TO THE ARCTIC**\n\nStep onto three vast Arctic islands \u2014 frozen tundra, glacier mountains, and aurora-lit fjords. No enemies, no pressure, just the freedom to fly, sail, climb, and explore a stunning open-world Arctic wilderness unlike anything else in VR.\n\n{3510237139138987}\n\n**WHAT'S NEW IN v1.0**\n\n- MANUAL FLIGHT \u2014 Pilot the hang glider with full wind physics\n- MANUAL SAILING \u2014 Sail your own boat between islands; mini-map in HUD\n- 120fps QUEST 3 / 90fps QUEST 2 \u2014 Buttery smooth performance\n- HDRP SKY \u2014 Aurora and northern lights rebuilt\n- PARTICLE WATER \u2014 Cleaner, more reactive ocean surfaces\n- NATURAL MOVEMENT \u2014 No jitter, no motion sickness\n\n{1450340413806211}\n{1015705464137450}\n{963609493393830}\n\n**WHAT YOU CAN DO**\n\n- Hang glide off glacier cliffs\n- Sail across the open Arctic ocean\n- Ride a 1,000-foot mechanical ropeway\n- Bungee jump from frozen cliffs\n- Rescue arctic wildlife\n- Launch fireworks over the aurora sky\n\n{1739680450540276}\n{871258366044770}\n{1333818298958779}\n\n**BUILT FOR EVERYONE**\n\n- Comfort Mode default \u2014 no motion sickness\n- Family-friendly \u2014 no violence, no fail states\n- Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest 3S, Quest Pro supported\n\nWe're Gioco Studio \u2014 3 people in Singapore. We wanted a game you could hand to anyone and they'd just get it.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf **50% off through Summer Fest**\n\n\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Follow @giocostudio for free DLC drops", "short_description": "Pilot a hang glider through Arctic wind currents. Sail your own boat between three frozen islands. Climb a 1,000-foot ropeway, bungee-jump from glacier cliffs, fish on ice lakes, and light up the aurora with fireworks. A laid-back open-world VR adventure built for everyone \u2014 no combat, no fail states, no motion sickness. Now running at 120fps on Quest 3 and 90fps on Quest 2 with HDRP sky and improved water. Comfort Mode default. Family-friendly. Built by a 3-person indie studio."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://giocostudio.com/giocoapps/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gioco Studio", "support_website_ur